# The build context of Dockerfile is the repository root: what the images build from, and nothing of
# a laptop's: no environment file above all (docs/rules/security.md §4), no install, no build output,
# and of deploy/ only its package and the build's own script, so that a change there rebuilds nothing.
.git
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.generated.*
core/packages/db/generated
.pnpm-store
.tmp
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.changeset
docs
deploy/*
!deploy/package.json
!deploy/images
